DevTools' copy of Puppeteer includes api-extractor's rollups of its type declarations
(lib/types.d.ts, and lib/es5-iife/puppeteer-core-browser.d.ts made from it), which nothing
imports: DevTools uses the per-module declarations. They are generated, and api-extractor
isn't available from source, so leave them out (the ebuild deletes them).

--- a/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/front_end/third_party/puppeteer/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/front_end/third_party/puppeteer/BUILD.gn
@@ -7,6 +7,9 @@
